- MCP incremental sync: implement `_mcp_incremental_sync` in `dispatch.py` (git pull + GitHub MCP `compare_commits`)
- C8 graph builder: NetworkX merge of EXTRACTED + INFERRED edges, Leiden clustering via graspologic
